cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  perch-hoplite-orcas-MBNMS: Bigg's killer whale detection in the
  MBARI MARS hydrophone archive using frozen Perch V2 embeddings
message: >-
  If you use this software, models, or labels, please cite both this
  repository and the associated OCEANS 2026 poster.
type: software
authors:
